"و انتقال تجربه فراهم کرده‌ایم."
msgstr ""
"The goal of establishing Kian Sanat Academy is to bridge the gap between "
"theoretical knowledge and industrial needs. By leveraging our experience in "
"executing large-scale projects, we have provided a space for specialized "
"training and experience transfer."

#: .\core\templates\core\about.html:622
